== Usage ==
'''Buzzybee's Fantabulous Disco Destination''' can be placed anywhere in {{zone|The Garden}} and filled with [[Pest Vinyls]]. Offline [[Pests]] will spawn within {{Green|10}} blocks of it if their corresponding vinyl has been inserted. Only one '''Buzzybee's Fantabulous Disco Destination''' can be placed on {{zone|The Garden}}.

